        "raw": "<p>My group has not acctually played yet but plan to do so before long, but a couple of the guys are weirded out by the turn order system.&nbsp; So wanted to ask if others have had any issues with it?&nbsp; They are trying to see why anyone would ever let the villians go before all the heros do?&nbsp; If you can go before them and have a chance to finish them off or hurt them why let them go first?&nbsp; Then villans do the same thing, they all go, then pick the eviroment to end the turn and pick the villians all again.&nbsp; So the villians as a whole get to go twice in a row.&nbsp; Then the heros all go and then pick the heros again .&nbsp; ANd it just goes back and forth with each group going twice in a row each time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So have other people encountered this happening?&nbsp; Has anyone found a good way to not have it happen?</p>",
