        "id": 211021,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-17T01:38:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have not played the RPG.&nbsp; But from what I've gathered, my impression is that combat is going to last multiple rounds.&nbsp; Therefore, the chance that the heroes can avoid the enemy's turn by making them go last is slim.&nbsp; And the benefits to having the heroes go before the villain are less then the downsides that come with letting the villains take two turns in a row.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:41:28.535Z",
