        "raw": "<p>I have not played the RPG.&nbsp; But from what I&#39;ve gathered, my impression is that combat is going to last multiple rounds.&nbsp; Therefore, the chance that the heroes can avoid the enemy&#39;s turn by making them go last is slim.&nbsp; And the benefits to having the heroes go before the villain are less then the downsides that come with letting the villains take two turns in a row.</p>",
